      "text": "Located in the northwest of the archipelago, in the Windward (Barlavento) group, the island covers an area of 227 km2 with a population of 76,107.1 The population is markedly urban – 92.6% live in the port city of Mindelo, the second largest city in the country; Mindelo has traditionally been considered a cultural centre of Cape Verde."
     }
